# Copy to apps/backend/data/cashfree.env and fill in.
# Cashfree Secure ID Verification (DigiLocker + PAN). Not the payment gateway key.
# KALEYRA_API_KEY in kaleyra.env does not cover this.
#
# Option A — point at an existing .env (parkpe-platform uses CASHFREE_API_KEY / CASHFREE_API_SECRET):
# AUTH_CASHFREE_ENV=/path/to/backend/.env
#
# Option B — set keys here directly:
# CASHFREE_CLIENT_ID=
# CASHFREE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# CASHFREE_PUBLIC_KEY_PATH=
# CASHFREE_VERIFICATION_BASE_URL=https://sandbox.cashfree.com